{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/45825daed63b6467b6a6fb1f9358e4021843ec5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_a!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> positive to be \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/f/86f3a88a9903c2f7f0a9fe9c6dc1d55e2d8a6305.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n_a ! = n (n-a)(n-2a)(n-3a)...(n-ka)\\]\" width=\"328\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is the greatest integer for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/9134adf5315bd55ffe9826efcf07f5e2db321607.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;ka$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />. Then the quotient <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f51236164c8f41482c1c3b9c8e355f2c4e7e54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72_8!/18_2!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63beadf99c424ca78057e85b2b93585d10b4eb93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4^5 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4^6 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4^8 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4^9 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 4^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"391\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the definition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/45825daed63b6467b6a6fb1f9358e4021843ec5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_a!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" />, the quotient can be rewritten as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/1/8d1ee6d8d1ff628deae5e9af0c56b86a52f32ab9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{72 \\cdot 64 \\cdot 56 \\cdots 8}{18 \\cdot 16 \\cdot 14 \\cdots 2}\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"38\" />\nNote that for a given integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/8880249cd7fc99c918ea6bebe11cb9484c3d298c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{72-8x}{18-2x} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e60c26a5726e3803b17a4625ca994107243a7814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le x \\le 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, the quotient simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7e7c4030f2152b5f3b84dd7e2a3bf1880a752c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4^9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"63\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\